{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/photo_2-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/photo_3-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆\nん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、寒い中イベントにお越しいただいた皆さま！\nありがとうございました\nたくさんの方と握手ができ、お話ができ、\nめちゃくちゃ楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中には仕事や授業を\nパスしてまで来て下さった方もいて…\nその分に値する程の満足をして\nいただけたかは分かりませんが\nわたしたちは、皆さまから\nいっぱいいっぱいエネルギーをいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントは22.23.24.25もあります\n昨日、今日来て下さった方も\nまだ行ってないって方も\n是非会いにきてください！！\n(わたしは、あと25日にいます。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、記者会見に出ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は髪型ストレートでしたえへ\nじどりをしてもなかなか良いのがとれず…\n伏せ目が好きなので\nななの伏せ目の写真をば！\nヽ(●＾▽＾●)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今\nなかなか駅に止まらんなって思ってたら\n快速やって\n降りる駅だいぶ通り過ぎてたぁぁぁぁ\nくぅー！\nやってしもうた！恥！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ買った靴です\nかんわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次くらいに、どいやさん出るかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}